        {
          "sid": "fruitveg-t1-s01",
          "c": "我每日食一個蘋果。",
          "j": "ngo5 mui5 jat6 sik6 jat1 go3 ping4 gwo2.",
          "e": "I eat an apple every day.",
          "note": "每 (mui5) means \"every\" — 每日 (mui5 jat6) \"every day\", 每朝 (mui5 ziu1) \"every morning\". Note the all-purpose classifier 個 (go3) on the apple: 一個蘋果 (jat1 go3 ping4 gwo2).",
