        {
          "sid": "fruitveg-t1-s02",
          "c": "呢啲生果好甜。",
          "j": "ni1 di1 saang1 gwo2 hou2 tim4.",
          "e": "These fruits are very sweet.",
          "note": "生果 (saang1 gwo2) is the Cantonese word for \"fruit\" (Mandarin says 水果 (seoi2 gwo2)). 呢啲 (ni1 di1) \"these\" uses the plural classifier 啲 (di1).",
          "bd": [
