        {
          "sid": "fruitveg-t1-s03",
          "c": "你鍾意食邊種生果？",
          "j": "nei5 zung1 ji3 sik6 bin1 zung2 saang1 gwo2?",
          "e": "Which fruit do you like?",
          "note": "<strong>邊種</strong> (bin1 zung2) is \"which kind / type\" — 種 (zung2) is the classifier for varieties of things. Swap the last word to ask about anything: 邊種菜 (bin1 zung2 coi3) \"which kind of vegetable\".",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "你",
              "j": "nei5",
              "e": "you"
