            {
              "c": "生果",
              "j": "saang1 gwo2",
              "e": "fruit"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "fruitveg-t1-s04",
          "c": "我想買啲薯仔同番茄。",
          "j": "ngo5 soeng2 maai5 di1 syu4 zai2 tung4 faan1 ke2.",
          "e": "I want to buy some potatoes and tomatoes.",
          "note": "Here 啲 (di1) means \"some\" (not a specific number) — 買啲薯仔 (maai5 di1 syu4 zai2) \"buy some potatoes\". Note the Cantonese 薯仔 (syu4 zai2) \"potato\"; the 仔 (zai2) \"little\" suffix is everywhere in Cantonese names.",
