        {
          "sid": "fruitveg-t1-s05",
          "c": "西瓜夏天最好食。",
          "j": "sai1 gwaa1 haa6 tin1 zeoi3 hou2 sik6.",
          "e": "Watermelon is best in summer.",
          "note": "<strong>最</strong> (zeoi3) means \"most\" — 最好食 (zeoi3 hou2 sik6) \"the best-tasting / nicest to eat\". A time word like 夏天 (haa6 tin1) \"summer\" needs no word for \"in\" — it simply goes before the verb.",
